WEBVTT

00:00:03.560 --> 00:00:07.150
I activate this card from my hand!

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:09.620
The Seal of Orichalcos!

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:48.070
Before I knew it, I abandoned happiness to survive

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:55.210
Lying to myself, I danced clinging on to illusions

00:00:55.990 --> 00:01:01.870
At the edge of my vision when I close my eyes

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:07.860
I was searching for your smile

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:15.230
With our memories fading

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:22.310
We hold on to our dreams and run  Yeah

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:29.210
These feelings that I shut away in my heart

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:36.440
I'll now grasp them again

00:01:56.430 --> 00:02:01.970
Darkness Inside Yugi
Timaeus Vanishes

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:13.640
Receive the power of Orichalcos, Dark Magician Girl the Dragon Knight!

00:02:13.640 --> 00:02:16.250
It gains 500 attack points!

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:21.690
Since its attack points changed, Crystal Seal is destroyed!

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.370
Why did Timaeus vanish?

00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:38.570
I tricked you.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:43.540
The Orichalcos and the legendary dragons' powers are like light and dark.

00:02:43.840 --> 00:02:45.940
They can't work together.

00:02:46.940 --> 00:02:49.920
I no longer feel nervous.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.120
Timaeus...

00:02:56.790 --> 00:03:03.530
But I possess the power to summon ten powered-up monsters.

00:03:04.020 --> 00:03:10.480
Even if The Seal of Orichalcos is a trap, I must use its power to fight!

00:03:10.870 --> 00:03:14.100
I activate the spell card, Hand Control!

00:03:14.320 --> 00:03:19.580
If you guess the name of a card in my hand correctly, I'm forced to activate it.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:23.550
The card you want to use is Necromancy.

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:25.710
Then use it, Yugi!

00:03:27.920 --> 00:03:30.590
Necromancy's effect activates!

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:35.120
I summon four monsters from the graveyard in defense position!

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:43.530
Come out!  Big Shield Gardna, Berfomet, Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts and Kuribabylon!

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:46.910
I tribute Gazelle and Berfomet!

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.150
Come out, Dark Magician!

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.580
Next is Kuribabylon's effect!

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:56.580
Separate, Kuribabylon!

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:03.020
My monsters, receive Orichalcos's power!

00:04:13.080 --> 00:04:19.000
Due to Orichalcos's power, the Kuribohs also gain 500 attack points each!

00:04:22.180 --> 00:04:25.640
Kuribah's effect activates!

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:28.850
Show yourself again, Kuribabylon!

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:36.880
Kuribabylon's attack points are the sum of the Kuribohs' attack points.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:42.090
And Kuribabylon also gets the Orichalcos's power!

00:04:42.090 --> 00:04:46.530
So it has 4500 attack points!

00:04:46.740 --> 00:04:49.970
4500 attack points!

00:04:50.560 --> 00:04:53.910
His lineup is full of strong monsters!

00:04:54.120 --> 00:04:56.910
And he summoned them all at once.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:05:00.270
The Seal of Orichalcos is...

00:05:00.270 --> 00:05:01.850
...an unbelievable card!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.000
This is the power of the Orichalcos...

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:10.430
No, it's your power.

00:05:18.860 --> 00:05:20.770
Where am I?

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:25.900
You can't!

00:05:26.280 --> 00:05:27.840
My other self!

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:31.780
Guardian Kay'est can't be attacked.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:36.080
In that case, Kuribabylon attacks Guardian Grarl!

00:05:37.660 --> 00:05:39.850
Guardian Grarl...

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:46.260
Since a monster went to your graveyard, Purity of the Cemetery is destroyed.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:53.200
Dark Magician and Dark Magician Girl still can attack.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.570
Go, Dark Magician!

00:05:56.600 --> 00:05:59.320
The Quick-Play Spell, Aid to the Doomed!

00:06:01.010 --> 00:06:02.140
What?

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:03.710
Aid to the Doomed.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:08.360
When my monster is destroyed, I can discard two cards...

00:06:08.360 --> 00:06:13.080
...to activate it from my hand during your turn and end the battle.

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.460
Yugi!

00:06:25.390 --> 00:06:26.520
Yugi...

00:06:26.520 --> 00:06:31.230
No way!  Why does Yugi have the mark of the Orichalcos?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:36.790
You came too?

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.900
Haga and Ryuzaki.

00:06:38.900 --> 00:06:41.690
So this is where you've been.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:46.470
Why does Yugi have their mark?

00:06:46.470 --> 00:06:49.880
Because he used it, of course!

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.060
Used what?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.060
You mean their card?

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:55.400
Haga is telling the truth!

00:06:55.400 --> 00:06:59.070
They used Exchange to trade their hands!

00:06:59.070 --> 00:07:00.540
No way...

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:05.000
Yugi...

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:25.190
You thought I couldn't master The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:28.190
But you were wrong.

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:34.430
You'll regret giving me The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:37.200
The Nameless Pharaoh is impressive.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:41.910
He brought out the full power of the Orichalcos in just one turn.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:48.290
My monsters, lend me your strength!

00:07:48.290 --> 00:07:50.080
My turn!

00:07:51.760 --> 00:07:53.090
Eatos...

00:07:53.900 --> 00:07:56.620
The spell card, Monster Reincarnation!

00:07:57.140 --> 00:08:01.380
Monster Reincarnation returns a monster in my graveyard to my deck.

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:06.000
I return Guardian Grarl from my graveyard to my deck!

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:10.430
You really don't want any monster in your graveyard.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:14.090
Then I set one card.

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:19.310
And I activate my spell card, Swords of Revealing Light!

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:30.540
Yugi can't attack for three turns.

00:08:30.540 --> 00:08:35.810
But Rafael can't do anything more than avoid Yugi's attacks.

00:08:36.420 --> 00:08:37.230
Yugi...

00:08:38.300 --> 00:08:39.660
My turn!

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:48.320
I tribute Big Shield Gardna to summon Catapult Turtle!

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:54.940
By tributing a monster, Catapult Turtle deals you damage...

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:59.510
...equal to half the tributed monster's attack points.

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:02.620
Swords of Revealing Light can't stop this!

00:09:03.530 --> 00:09:07.340
The Continuous Trap, Limit Tribute!

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.490
What?

00:09:10.700 --> 00:09:18.430
Due to Limit Tribute, we both can only tribute one monster per turn.

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:23.370
Since you Tribute Summoned Catapult Turtle this turn...

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.860
...you cannot tribute another monster.

00:09:27.870 --> 00:09:29.800
I end my turn.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:31.480
My turn.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.850
The spell card, Nightmare Binding!

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:45.030
What?

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:50.400
Nightmare Binding lowers a monster's attack points by 800...

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:55.140
...and adds them to my life points.

00:09:55.140 --> 00:09:59.410
And that monster cannot be tributed.

00:09:59.720 --> 00:10:05.110
Even if I can't tribute Kuribabylon, I'll still win!

00:10:05.110 --> 00:10:06.280
My turn!

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:12.480
Catapult Turtle fires Dark Magician!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:15.990
Go, Dark Magician!

00:10:26.840 --> 00:10:29.540
Since Dark Magician is in the graveyard...

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.880
...Dark Magician Girl gains attack points!

00:10:37.310 --> 00:10:39.710
Why, Yugi?

00:10:39.980 --> 00:10:41.820
What's wrong, Rafael?

00:10:41.820 --> 00:10:45.650
This match is settled.  Just one more turn.

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:49.590
The next attack will erase all your life points.

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.270
My turn!

00:10:57.060 --> 00:11:01.540
I set a card and end my turn.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:03.470
My turn!

00:11:04.380 --> 00:11:07.760
This will finish it, Rafael.

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:10.810
I tribute Dark Magician Girl!

00:11:12.580 --> 00:11:13.950
Don't!

00:11:14.340 --> 00:11:17.390
My other self, don't do it!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:22.020
Did you forget the promise you made with Dark Magician Girl?

00:11:27.070 --> 00:11:28.000
Take this!

00:11:35.180 --> 00:11:37.940
The spell card, Shrink!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:39.380
What?

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:42.500
Rafael weakened her with a spell card!

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:51.460
You're stubborn.

00:11:51.460 --> 00:11:54.690
But I now have more life points than you.

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:02.600
Swords of Revealing Light disappeared this turn.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:08.500
When Catapult Turtle tributes itself next turn, you'll have 0 life points.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:11.140
I win.

00:12:30.100 --> 00:12:31.720
Wow!

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:34.630
Yugi's pretty much going to win!

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:36.680
That's our Yugi!

00:12:36.680 --> 00:12:38.270
Right, Jonouchi?

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:41.520
What's wrong, Jonouchi?

00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:45.990
That's not Yugi!

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:51.340
Sacrifice his own monsters to win?

00:12:51.340 --> 00:12:54.010
That's not what a true duelist does!

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:08.800
The darkness in my other self's heart is getting stronger.

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:14.170
You want to win, don't you?

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:18.610
No matter who, no matter how.

00:13:20.390 --> 00:13:22.780
Well done, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:13:22.780 --> 00:13:25.480
How's it feel to know that you'll win?

00:13:25.960 --> 00:13:28.840
You have fully proved...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:34.090
That there's darkness in your heart.

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:41.700
Nameless Pharaoh, you trapped yourself because you were desperate to win.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:43.630
What?

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:50.660
As the darkness in your heart grows stronger, so does The Seal of Orichalcos.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:53.350
Haven't you noticed yet?

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:56.390
Look at your own field!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:05.460
Your obsession with victory made your cute monsters ugly.

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.990
You became a prisoner of power!

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:10.920
I did that to my monsters?

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:17.400
You used The Seal of Orichalcos to seal Timaeus's power.

00:14:17.400 --> 00:14:21.370
The legendary power of the Duel Monsters world.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:27.310
You didn't realize the only thing I feared was the legendary dragon's power!

00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:28.480
What?

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:30.180
My turn!

00:14:30.780 --> 00:14:35.420
This draw will determine both our fates!

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:42.360
Eatos, you finally came to me.

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.660
The Equip Spell, Celestial Sword – Eatos!

00:14:52.470 --> 00:14:55.240
Come out, Guardian Eatos!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:18.790
That's the true form of his protective aura!

00:15:21.100 --> 00:15:23.400
Guardian Eatos's effect!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.600
Soul of Celestial Sword!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:33.250
W-What?

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.250
I can't control my own body!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.250
Yugi!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:48.690
Guardian Eatos's effect banishes monster cards from your graveyard and absorbs their attack points.

00:15:49.060 --> 00:15:50.490
What?

00:15:50.490 --> 00:15:51.790
The first card...

00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:54.790
...is Dark Magician Girl!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:00.270
Dark Magician Girl...

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:03.270
The second is Dark Magician!

00:16:06.620 --> 00:16:08.570
Dark Magician!

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:11.360
The third is Big Shield Gardna.

00:16:11.360 --> 00:16:13.850
Fourth!  Gazelle the King of Mythical Beasts!

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:16.000
Fifth!  Berfomet!

00:16:23.600 --> 00:16:30.110
Nameless Pharaoh, remember what you did to these monsters.

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:38.200
Your heart's darkness led them to their demise.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:48.310
Don't look at me like that!

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:53.820
Your heart's darkness brings out the full strength of Eatos's effect!

00:17:08.140 --> 00:17:09.870
The attack points are...

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:11.170
...10000?

00:17:11.170 --> 00:17:12.480
No way!

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:13.870
Yugi!

00:17:14.080 --> 00:17:18.330
Nameless Pharaoh, feel the rage of your monsters!

00:17:18.680 --> 00:17:21.290
Guardian Eatos attacks!

00:17:24.490 --> 00:17:26.190
Forbidden Gospel!

00:17:48.830 --> 00:17:52.410
Yugi!

00:17:55.320 --> 00:17:57.280
My other self!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:20.110
Nameless Pharaoh, you lost something important in this duel.

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:28.730
You'll be sacrificed for our god's resurrection.

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:33.350
Goodbye, Nameless Pharaoh.

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:35.290
My other self!

00:18:37.520 --> 00:18:39.690
Oh yeah!  I'll use this!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.760
My other self!

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.480
Partner!

00:18:58.060 --> 00:18:59.140
Partner!

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:03.420
I trust you, my other... self.

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.790
Partner!

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.540
Yugi... lost.

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.290
No way!

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.540
Yugi...

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:30.980
Yugi...  Yugi!

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.050
I'll take this back.

00:20:03.720 --> 00:20:04.780
Yugi!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:06.950
Catch!

00:20:08.570 --> 00:20:09.380
Yugi!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:14.270
Jonouchi!  I'll be back for your soul soon!

00:20:14.270 --> 00:20:16.830
Look forward to it!

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.400
Hey!  Wait!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.720
Hang in there!

00:20:20.720 --> 00:20:21.760
Yugi!

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:23.700
Hey.

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:25.630
Yeah.  I know.

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:28.160
Yugi...

00:20:28.160 --> 00:20:30.080
Come on, Yugi!

00:20:30.080 --> 00:20:30.980
Yugi!

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:32.370
Yugi!

00:20:35.940 --> 00:20:37.120
Yugi!

00:20:37.440 --> 00:20:39.300
You're awake!

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:41.510
Are you okay?

00:20:41.510 --> 00:20:45.650
You worried us!  Thank goodness!

00:20:46.320 --> 00:20:48.050
What's wrong, Yugi?

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:49.950
I...

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:52.890
I'm not okay.

00:20:53.550 --> 00:20:55.260
What are you talking about?

00:20:55.260 --> 00:20:56.690
You seem fine.

00:20:57.330 --> 00:21:00.910
They took my partner instead of me...

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:32.130
So the soul that's captured is...

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:35.070
I...  I...

00:21:37.660 --> 00:21:40.870
Partner!

00:21:58.570 --> 00:22:07.480
The streets flow by, colored in red

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:15.890
If you notice your pain, it changes to joy

00:22:17.550 --> 00:22:26.980
People learn of friendship every time they wipe their tears

00:22:27.590 --> 00:22:36.500
With the warm strength you gave me, I'll change them into kindness

00:22:37.070 --> 00:22:45.530
My overflowing emotions don't stop

00:22:46.310 --> 00:22:51.040
I'll live feeling them

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:56.220
For me to be me

00:22:56.220 --> 00:23:04.680
Overflowing friendship heals me

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:10.320
Our chance meeting was real

00:23:10.840 --> 00:23:20.050
We'll both understand that someday

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:30.850
Yugi lost?  You must be joking!

00:23:30.850 --> 00:23:37.690
Yugi escaped many pinches and won, so I can't believe he lost now!

00:23:37.690 --> 00:23:41.090
Deeply hurt, the other Yugi is depressed.

00:23:41.090 --> 00:23:47.500
But you're the only one who can defeat Doma and retrieve Yugi's soul!

00:23:47.500 --> 00:23:49.400
Please!  Stand up!

00:23:49.400 --> 00:23:51.820
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
Torn Soul

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:53.370
Duel, standby!
